      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "\u2022Primary lymphoma of the female genital tract accounts for 1% of extranodal lymphomas.\u2022Approximately 13% are diffuse large B cell lymphoma of the uterus, most often involving the endometrial stroma or cervix.\u2022The first double-expressor diffuse large B cell lymphoma confined to a uterine leiomyoma is described."},
